@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = <chuoi_jwt>

### Auth - Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "email": "user.demo@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Auth - Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "email": "new.user@example.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "phone": "0909123456"
}

### Profile - Get current user profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Profile - Update current user profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A Updated",
  "phone": "0909123456",
  "homeAddress": "123 Đường Lê Lợi, Quận 1, TP.HCM"
}

### Tickets - My tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/my-tickets?tab=UPCOMING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tickets - Ticket detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/101
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vouchers - My vouchers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vouchers/my-vouchers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1. Vouchers - Lấy danh sách Voucher khả dụng (SCRUM-100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vouchers/my-vouchers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Vouchers - Kiểm tra & Áp dụng Voucher giảm giá (SCRUM-100)
# Trường hợp 1: Áp dụng mã hợp lệ
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vouchers/apply
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{
  "code": "CINE20K",
  "subtotal": 170000
}

### 2.1. Vouchers - Thử áp dụng mã giảm theo phần trăm
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vouchers/apply
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{
  "code": "CINEONE10",
  "subtotal": 250000
}

### 3. Bookings - Tạo đơn đặt vé giữ chỗ 10 phút (SCRUM-100 -> SCRUM-101)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{
  "showtimeId": 1,
  "seatIds": [],
  "subtotal": 170000,
  "discountAmount": 20000,
  "totalAmount": 150000,
  "voucherCode": "CINE20K"
}

### 4. Payments - Tạo liên kết & Mã QR VietQR payOS (SCRUM-101)
# Thay {bookingId} bằng ID đơn vừa tạo ở API trên (ví dụ bookingId = 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/create-link/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Payments - Kiểm tra trạng thái thanh toán & Đồng bộ trực tiếp payOS (SCRUM-101)
# Gọi khi Mobile chạy Polling mỗi 2s hoặc khi người dùng bấm "Tôi đã chuyển khoản - Kiểm tra ngay"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/status/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Payments - Giả lập Webhook payOS xác nhận thanh toán thành công (Webhook Mock)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "code": "00",
  "desc": "success",
  "data": {
    "orderCode": 123456789,
    "amount": 150000,
    "description": "CNE123456",
    "accountNumber": "VQRQANJWA0450",
    "reference": "FT240101",
    "transactionDateTime": "2026-11-06 19:30:00",
    "currency": "VND",
    "paymentLinkId": "cne_test_link_id"
  },
  "signature": "test_signature"
}

### 1. [SCRUM-113] Lấy Tiến độ hạng thành viên, Chi tiêu thực tế & Danh sách quyền lợi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/memberships/my-tier
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### 2. [SCRUM-114] Ví Voucher - Tab "Khả dụng" (AVAILABLE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vouchers/my-vouchers?tab=AVAILABLE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### 3. [SCRUM-114] Ví Voucher - Tab "Đã sử dụng" (USED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vouchers/my-vouchers?tab=USED
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### 4. [SCRUM-114] Ví Voucher - Tab "Hết hạn" (EXPIRED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vouchers/my-vouchers?tab=EXPIRED
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### 5. [SCRUM-114] Xem Chi tiết Voucher theo Mã (Ví dụ: CINE50K hoặc CINE20K)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vouchers/detail/CINE20K
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}